{
  "description": "ChaosExperimentAction, ChaosTargetSelector and ChaosTargetFilter are polymorphic (on `type`); the converted model keeps only the discriminators, so S.Struct strips `duration`/`parameters`/`selectorId` (continuous/discrete/delay actions), `targets` (List selectors), `queryString`/`subscriptionIds` (Query selectors) and the Simple filter's `parameters`. Add them as optional members.",
  "patches": [
